00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:18.800
I said a lot of what we did at Gymshark

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:21.200
wasn't necessarily a conscious decision.

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:23.080
This was a conscious decision for us. We

00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:25.200
